---
// The app is authenticated-only; / has no marketing page. Authenticated users are sent to
// the home; unauthenticated hits are already intercepted by middleware → /auth/signin.
// Redirect via Astro.response (302 + Location) rather than `return Astro.redirect(...)`:
// a top-level frontmatter `return` crashes @typescript-eslint/no-misused-promises, so the
// repo sets the response directly instead (same pattern as plans/[id].astro's status codes).
Astro.response.status = 302;
Astro.response.headers.set("Location", "/dashboard");
---
